WEBVTT

00:09.379 --> 00:09.517
Are you ready, kids?
孩子们，你们准备好了吗？

00:10.896 --> 00:11.000
KIDS:
Aye, aye, Captain!
儿童：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:12.482 --> 00:12.620
I can't hear you.
我听不到你说话。

00:14.172 --> 00:14.310
[ louder]:
Aye, aye, Captain!
[更大声]：
是啊是啊，队长！

00:15.758 --> 00:15.896
♪ Oh...
♪ 哦...

00:19.103 --> 00:19.241
♪ Who lives in a pineapple
under the sea? ♪
♪ 谁住在菠萝里
在海底？ ♪

00:21.034 --> 00:21.172
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:23.137 --> 00:23.275
♪ Absorbent and yellow
and porous is he. ♪
♪ 吸水性和黄色
他是多孔的。 ♪

00:25.344 --> 00:25.482
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:27.206 --> 00:27.344
♪ If nautical nonsense be
something you wish... ♪
♪ 如果航海方面的废话是
你想要的东西...♪

00:29.137 --> 00:29.275
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:31.000 --> 00:31.137
♪ Then drop on the deck
and flop like a fish. ♪
♪ 然后落在甲板上
然后像鱼一样扑通扑通。 ♪

00:33.172 --> 00:33.310
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!♪
♪ 海绵宝宝！♪

00:35.137 --> 00:35.275
♪ Ready?
SpongeBob SquarePants! ♪
♪ 准备好了吗？
海绵宝宝！ ♪

00:36.965 --> 00:37.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:39.965 --> 00:40.068
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:41.275 --> 00:41.413
♪ SpongeBob SquarePants!
♪ 海绵宝宝！

00:43.379 --> 00:43.517
[ laughs heartily]
[开怀大笑]

00:47.000 --> 00:47.103
[ plays airy tune]
[演奏轻快的曲子]

00:49.344 --> 00:49.482
Captioning sponsored
by MTV NETWORKS
字幕赞助
由 MTV 网络提供

01:04.379 --> 01:04.517
[ SpongeBob and Patrick
laughing]
[海绵宝宝和帕特里克
笑]

01:11.344 --> 01:11.482
Whoa!
哇！

01:12.551 --> 01:12.689
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:17.172 --> 01:17.310
[ laughing heartily]
[开怀大笑]

01:22.758 --> 01:22.896
You're it.
你就是它。

01:24.034 --> 01:24.172
[ both laughing]
[两人都笑了]

01:25.724 --> 01:25.862
You're it.
你就是它。

01:27.137 --> 01:27.275
Wait, Pat--
you're it!
等等，帕特——
你就是它！

01:29.965 --> 01:30.068
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

01:31.620 --> 01:31.758
The sign!
标志！

01:33.517 --> 01:33.655
[ laughter turns to fear]
[笑声转为恐惧]

01:38.482 --> 01:38.620
[ yells]
[大喊]

01:41.586 --> 01:41.724
[ thud]
[砰]

01:42.586 --> 01:42.724
Patrick!
帕特里克！

01:44.413 --> 01:44.551
Let me help you
out of there, buddy.
让我来帮助你
离开那里，伙计。

01:50.206 --> 01:50.344
Is the rest of you down there?
你们其他人都在下面吗？

01:52.482 --> 01:52.620
The rest of me is up here.
我的其余部分都在这里。

01:54.172 --> 01:54.310
Ooh, you had me
worried there, buddy.
哦，你有我
那里很担心，伙计。

01:56.689 --> 01:56.827
[ laughs]
[笑]

01:57.827 --> 01:57.965
Here's your head.
这是你的头。

01:59.068 --> 01:59.206
[ laughs obnoxiously]
[讨厌地笑]

02:09.827 --> 02:09.965
I find all this laughter
to be highly illogical.
我发现这一切的笑声
非常不合逻辑。

02:13.137 --> 02:13.275
Well, let's stop laughing
and let's start fishing.
好吧，我们别笑了
让我们开始钓鱼吧。

02:16.310 --> 02:16.448
Go ahead,
you get first crack.
继续吧，
你得到了第一个破解。

02:19.068 --> 02:19.206
Look at them-- these graceful
stoic creatures of the deep.
看看他们——这些优雅的
坚忍的深海生物。

02:22.689 --> 02:22.827
Huh? Those are
some big words, Pat.
啊？那些是
一些大话，帕特。

02:24.586 --> 02:24.724
I've never heard you
use them before.
我从来没有听说过你
之前使用它们。

02:26.482 --> 02:26.620
Nonsense, my vocabulary
is infinitely expanding.
废话，我的词汇
正在无限扩大。

02:30.000 --> 02:30.103
Well, let's expand
our jellyfish nets.
嗯，我们来扩展一下
我们的水母网。

02:32.517 --> 02:32.655
Come on, Patrick.
来吧，帕特里克。

02:39.103 --> 02:39.241
Look, buddy,
I captured one.
看，伙计，
我抓获了一只。

02:41.689 --> 02:41.827
Yes, I captured one
as well
是的，我抓到了一张
还有

02:44.448 --> 02:44.586
without disturbing
its delicate ecosystem.
不打扰
其脆弱的生态系统。

02:48.413 --> 02:48.551
It is wrong
to harness nature
这是错误的
驾驭自然

02:50.655 --> 02:50.793
in such
a barbaric manner.
在这样的
一种野蛮的方式。

02:54.310 --> 02:54.448
Okay.
好的。

02:55.827 --> 02:55.965
What do you
want to do?
你想让我做什么？

02:57.551 --> 02:57.689
Let us go off and admire
让我们出发去欣赏吧

02:59.344 --> 02:59.482
the beauty and
fragility of nature.
美丽和
自然的脆弱性。

03:02.413 --> 03:02.551
Pretty.
漂亮的。

03:04.068 --> 03:04.206
Yes, quite.
是的，相当。

03:05.620 --> 03:05.758
Fragile.
脆弱的。

03:06.620 --> 03:06.758
Indeed.
的确。

03:11.862 --> 03:11.965
Come on, Patrick,
let's do something fun.
来吧，帕特里克，
我们来做点有趣的事吧。

03:14.172 --> 03:14.310
Oh, you want to run
some statistics
哦，你想跑
一些统计数据

03:16.517 --> 03:16.655
or observe phenomenon
或观察现象

03:18.689 --> 03:18.827
and render hypothesis
of said phenomenon?
并提出假设
上述现象？

03:21.344 --> 03:21.482
I was thinking
more like jumping rope
我在想
更像是跳绳

03:23.448 --> 03:23.586
or one-legged races,
or playing duck-duck-
hermit crab.
或单腿赛跑，
或者玩鸭鸭游戏
寄居蟹。

03:29.965 --> 03:30.068
Doesn't feel like fun.
感觉不太好玩。

03:31.862 --> 03:31.965
How about some jokes.
讲点笑话怎么样。

03:34.000 --> 03:34.137
[ sighs]
[叹气]

03:36.068 --> 03:36.206
What's the difference
between a guitar
and a jellyfish?
有什么区别
吉他之间
还有水母？

03:38.206 --> 03:38.344
You can't strum a jellyfish.
你无法拨动水母。

03:40.551 --> 03:40.689
Yes!
是的！

03:42.275 --> 03:42.413
[ laughs obnoxiously]
[讨厌地笑]

03:44.379 --> 03:44.517
[ strums beautiful chord]
[弹奏优美的和弦]

03:46.758 --> 03:46.896
Oh, my,
look at the time.
哦，我的，
看看时间。

03:48.000 --> 03:48.137
I really must be going.
我真的必须走了。

03:50.655 --> 03:50.793
What's wrong with Patrick?
帕特里克怎么了？

03:52.517 --> 03:52.655
I sure hope he gets better soon.
我当然希望他尽快好起来。

03:59.034 --> 03:59.172
Are you better, Pat?
你好点了吗，帕特？

04:00.586 --> 04:00.724
Uh, what are you doing?
呃，你在做什么？

04:02.241 --> 04:02.379
Just studying
this amazing subspecies.
刚刚学习
这个惊人的亚种。

04:04.931 --> 04:05.034
I'll show you subspecies.
我将向您展示亚种。

04:06.931 --> 04:07.034
Want to visit
Squidward?
想要参观
章鱼哥？

04:08.482 --> 04:08.620
Since I am finished
with my work,
既然我已经完成了
和我的工作，

04:10.137 --> 04:10.275
I'll humor you
in your trivial pursuits.
我会逗你开心
在你琐碎的追求中。

04:14.724 --> 04:14.862
[ playing off-key melody]
[演奏走调旋律]

04:17.000 --> 04:17.103
I'd recognize that
piece anywhere:
我会认识到这一点
任何地方的一块：

04:19.344 --> 04:19.482
Cornelius Pufferfish's Opus 67,
"Symphony in Blue."
科尼利厄斯河豚的作品 67，
“蓝色交响曲”。

04:23.793 --> 04:23.931
Patrick?
帕特里克？

04:25.034 --> 04:25.172
It's a beautiful piece.
这是一件美丽的作品。

04:26.827 --> 04:26.965
Execution needs
some work.
执行需求
一些工作。

04:28.689 --> 04:28.827
May I suggest that
on the seventh bar
我可以建议一下吗
在第七小节

04:31.310 --> 04:31.448
of the adagio andante
that you add a little fortissimo
慢板行板
你添加一点强音

04:35.206 --> 04:35.344
on the arpeggiated b-flat scale?
在降b调琶音音阶上？

04:37.931 --> 04:38.034
Wow, I never thought
to do it like that.
哇，我从来没想过
那样做。

04:40.758 --> 04:40.896
Well, that is
because you rarely think.
嗯，那就是
因为你很少思考。

04:42.931 --> 04:43.034
How do you know
all that?
你怎么知道
所有这些？

04:44.758 --> 04:44.896
A creative outlet provides
a spiritual release
创意渠道提供
一种精神上的释放

04:48.137 --> 04:48.275
and helps facilitate
a healthy mental balance.
并有助于促进
健康的心理平衡。

04:52.034 --> 04:52.172
[ inhales deeply]
[深吸一口气]

04:53.931 --> 04:54.034
Does that include [ belching]
belch talking?
这包括[打嗝]吗
打嗝说话？

04:58.448 --> 04:58.586
Mr. SquarePants,
I find your humor vulgar.
方裤先生，
我觉得你的幽默很粗俗。

05:01.827 --> 05:01.965
I had no idea you
were so knowledgeable,
Patrick.
我不知道你
知识渊博，
帕特里克.

05:05.551 --> 05:05.689
Do you think
you could be
my musical mentor?
你认为
你可能是
我的音乐导师？

05:07.758 --> 05:07.896
Uh, guys?
呃，伙计们？

05:09.172 --> 05:09.275
Let's take it
from the top.
让我们接受吧
从顶部。

05:10.517 --> 05:10.655
[ squeaky notes]
[吱吱作响的音符]

05:12.034 --> 05:12.172
Not so excellent,
Squidward.
没有那么优秀，
章鱼哥。

05:14.827 --> 05:14.965
Let me demonstrate
the proper technique.
让我演示一下
正确的技术。

05:19.448 --> 05:19.586
On second thought,
practice makes perfect.
再一想，
熟能生巧。

05:22.000 --> 05:22.137
Let's begin.
让我们开始吧。

05:23.172 --> 05:23.310
[ playing nose]
[玩鼻子]

05:24.551 --> 05:24.689
Uh, thank you, my good chap.
嗯，谢谢你，我的好朋友。

05:26.689 --> 05:26.827
Unfortunately this is
a solo piece for clarinet only.
不幸的是这是
一首单簧管独奏曲。

05:30.034 --> 05:30.172
And one, two, three, four.
还有一、二、三、四。

05:31.620 --> 05:31.758
[ Squidward playing off-key]
[章鱼哥走调]

05:37.275 --> 05:37.413
PATRICK:
Stop! Enough!
帕特里克：
停下来！足够的！

05:40.137 --> 05:40.275
Find yourself a new mentor!
为自己寻找一位新导师！

05:43.862 --> 05:43.965
Now that you're free,
现在你自由了，

05:45.103 --> 05:45.241
let's get some grub.
我们来吃点东西吧。

05:46.620 --> 05:46.758
No, SpongeBob,
I'm afraid not.
不，海绵宝宝，
恐怕不是。

05:48.689 --> 05:48.827
Well, I have a brand new bottle
of super bubbly bubble soap.
嗯，我有一瓶全新的
超级起泡的泡泡皂。

05:55.517 --> 05:55.655
No, thanks again.
不，再次感谢。

05:57.793 --> 05:57.931
Maybe later
we can play pirates.
也许稍后
我们可以玩海盗。

05:59.206 --> 05:59.344
Robert, my dear, it's no use.
罗伯特，亲爱的，这没有用。

06:02.068 --> 06:02.206
We've just grown apart.
我们刚刚分开。

06:04.379 --> 06:04.517
What?
What do you mean?
什么？
你是什​​么意思？

06:06.379 --> 06:06.517
I know we've had fun
in the past,
我知道我们玩得很开心
过去，

06:09.275 --> 06:09.379
but we're just not
compatible anymore.
但我们只是不
兼容了。

06:12.482 --> 06:12.620
It's time we went
our separate ways.
我们是时候走了
我们各走各的路。

06:15.344 --> 06:15.482
Such is life.
这就是生活。

06:17.241 --> 06:17.379
But Patrick,
you're my best friend.
但是帕特里克，
你是我最好的朋友。

06:19.241 --> 06:19.379
I know it's hard,
but brace up, chap.
我知道这很难，
但振作起来，伙计。

06:22.103 --> 06:22.241
[ sniffling]:
Yeah.
[抽鼻子]：
是的。

06:23.827 --> 06:23.965
Maybe our paths
will cross again some day.
也许我们的路
总有一天会再次穿越。

06:26.482 --> 06:26.620
Think fondly of me,
Mr. SquarePants.
深情地想我，
方裤先生。

06:29.586 --> 06:29.724
Good-bye... Mr. Best Friend.
再见...最好的朋友先生。

06:34.000 --> 06:34.137
[ sobbing]
[抽泣]

06:37.344 --> 06:37.482
[ doorbell rings]
[门铃响]

06:38.482 --> 06:38.620
Sandy, you there?
桑迪，你在吗？

06:40.241 --> 06:40.379
I need some professional help.
我需要一些专业的帮助。

06:42.448 --> 06:42.586
[ Sandy and Patrick laughing]
[桑迪和帕特里克大笑]

06:45.275 --> 06:45.413
Patrick?
帕特里克？

06:46.965 --> 06:47.068
Well, Pat, the new you
gets an "A" plus.
好吧，帕特，新的你
获得“A”加分。

06:48.862 --> 06:48.965
Why, thank you, Sandra.
为什么，谢谢你，桑德拉。

06:50.827 --> 06:50.965
I find your
intellect rather
stimulating as well.
我找到你的
而是智力
也很刺激。

06:53.655 --> 06:53.793
SANDY:
Oh, really? Thanks.
桑迪：
哦，真的吗？谢谢。

06:55.482 --> 06:55.620
Patrick, what do you think
about this problem?
帕特里克，你觉得怎么样
关于这个问题？

06:58.000 --> 06:58.103
You simply change the literal
term to a coefficient
您只需更改文字即可
系数项

07:01.034 --> 07:01.172
and the minuend will achieve
the desired quotient.
被减数将实现
所需的商。

07:04.000 --> 07:04.137
Even the simplest of mammals
could figure it out
即使是最简单的哺乳动物
能弄清楚

07:06.448 --> 07:06.586
with a little thought.
稍加思考。

07:08.068 --> 07:08.206
What do you mean
by that, Patrick?
你是什么意思
帕特里克？

07:09.689 --> 07:09.827
I'm merely suggesting
我只是建议

07:11.482 --> 07:11.620
you lack the ability
to solve remedial equations.
你缺乏能力
求解补救方程。

07:14.310 --> 07:14.448
Are you suggesting
I'm dumb?
你在建议吗
我傻吗？

07:16.310 --> 07:16.448
I'd use a more sophisticated
word like "impaired."
我会使用更复杂的
像“受损”这样的词。

07:19.517 --> 07:19.655
I think
you'd better leave.
我认为
你最好离开。

07:21.655 --> 07:21.793
I was only
trying to help.
我只是
试图提供帮助。

07:23.517 --> 07:23.655
I don't need your kind
of help, Mr. Know-It-All.
我不需要你这种人
求帮助，万事通先生。

07:25.793 --> 07:25.931
I liked you better
when you were a barnaclehead!
我更喜欢你
当你还是藤壶头的时候！

07:31.103 --> 07:31.241
[ sniffling]:
I never thought I'd lose
my best friend.
[抽鼻子]：
我从没想过我会输
我最好的朋友。

07:33.896 --> 07:34.000
How can I compete with geniuses?
我怎样才能与天才竞争？

07:37.551 --> 07:37.689
[ crying]
[哭泣]

07:40.655 --> 07:40.793
Surrounded by knowledge
and no one to share it with,
被知识包围
却没有人可以分享，

07:45.000 --> 07:45.137
no one I can call friend.
没有人我可以称之为朋友。

07:48.000 --> 07:48.137
Who's that old chap
I used to run with?
那个老家伙是谁
我以前一起跑步？

07:51.620 --> 07:51.758
SpongeBob.
海绵宝宝。

07:56.896 --> 07:57.000
At least Patrick's my friend
in my memories.
至少帕特里克是我的朋友
在我的记忆中。

08:07.931 --> 08:08.034
Ah, the glory days.
啊，辉煌岁月。

08:10.896 --> 08:11.000
Why have we grown apart?
为什么我们渐行渐远？

08:14.310 --> 08:14.448
I must apply all that I know
to solve this problem.
我必须应用我所知道的一切
来解决这个问题。

08:26.689 --> 08:26.827
What could it be?
可能是什么？

08:33.517 --> 08:33.655
What's different?
有什么不同？

08:35.344 --> 08:35.482
[ screaming]:
What?!
[尖叫]：
什么？！

08:37.379 --> 08:37.517
I'd do anything to have my old
buddy back by my side again.
我愿意做任何事情来拥有我的旧时光
哥们又回到我身边了。

08:42.000 --> 08:42.137
[ banging on door]
[敲门]

08:43.655 --> 08:43.793
SPONGEBOB [ sadly]:
Coming.
海绵宝宝[悲伤]：
来了。

08:49.620 --> 08:49.758
Patrick--
you're kidnapping me?
帕特里克——
你在绑架我？

08:51.620 --> 08:51.758
Yes, I am.
我是。

08:53.344 --> 08:53.482
Yay!
耶！

09:03.724 --> 09:03.862
What should we do?
我们应该做什么？

09:05.206 --> 09:05.344
We are going to
have fun,
我们要去
玩得开心，

09:06.620 --> 09:06.758
whatever
the cost may be.
无论如何
成本可能是。

09:08.103 --> 09:08.241
Let's do this.
让我们这样做吧。

09:09.551 --> 09:09.689
Yes, let's have some fun.
是的，让我们玩得开心吧。

09:13.862 --> 09:13.965
Oh, yeah!
哦，是啊！

09:16.517 --> 09:16.655
Oh, absolutely!
哦，绝对！

09:19.758 --> 09:19.896
Are you quite sure I found
this activity to be fun?
你确定我找到了吗
这个活动好玩吗？

09:23.000 --> 09:23.137
Yeah.
是的。

09:25.379 --> 09:25.517
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

09:31.482 --> 09:31.620
That was fun, huh, Patrick?
那很有趣，是吧，帕特里克？

09:34.206 --> 09:34.344
[ mumbling]
[咕哝]

09:35.793 --> 09:35.931
[ sighs]
[叹气]

09:37.448 --> 09:37.586
When did the fun
go away, SpongeBob?
什么时候有好玩的
走开吧，海绵宝宝？

09:40.172 --> 09:40.310
It went away when you
jumped off that cliff
当你的时候它就消失了
跳下那个悬崖

09:42.241 --> 09:42.379
and knocked your head
clean off.
并敲了你的头
清理干净。

09:43.965 --> 09:44.068
That's it.
That's what?
就是这样。
那是什么？

09:45.517 --> 09:45.655
What are you doing?
你在干什么？

09:47.310 --> 09:47.448
I'm going to duplicate
my actions from that day
我要复制
从那天起我的行动

09:49.620 --> 09:49.758
to ascertain the origin
of my cha...an...nge!
以确定起源
我的改变...安...恩格！

09:55.689 --> 09:55.827
[ distant thud]
[远处的轰鸣声]

09:57.000 --> 09:57.137
SPONGEBOB:
Patrick!
海绵宝宝：
帕特里克！

09:58.103 --> 09:58.241
Hold on, buddy.
坚持住，伙计。

10:01.689 --> 10:01.827
There you go.
就这样吧。

10:02.931 --> 10:03.034
Don't worry, Patrick.
别担心，帕特里克。

10:04.793 --> 10:04.931
I found your head last time,
I'll find it again.
上次我找到你的头了
我会再找到它。

10:10.172 --> 10:10.310
Not back there,
not under here.
不回到那里，
不在这里。

10:12.379 --> 10:12.517
What if I can't find it?
如果我找不到怎么办？

10:14.275 --> 10:14.413
Oh, poor headless Patrick.
哦，可怜的无头帕特里克。

10:19.172 --> 10:19.310
Patrick,
your head is back.
帕特里克，
你的头回来了。

10:21.034 --> 10:21.172
But... uh...
do you feel different?
但是……呃……
你感觉不一样吗？

10:23.896 --> 10:24.000
Quite unchanged, actually.
事实上，完全没有变化。

10:25.827 --> 10:25.965
I guess we'll never
have fun together again.
我想我们永远不会
再次一起玩得开心。

10:30.137 --> 10:30.275
You said you found my dislodged
cranial cap last time.
你说你发现我被驱逐了
上次的颅盖。

10:34.000 --> 10:34.103
Yes?
是的？

10:35.344 --> 10:35.482
Where exactly
did you find it?
具体在哪里
你找到了吗？

10:37.551 --> 10:37.689
Um... it was right here.
嗯……就在这里。

10:39.896 --> 10:40.000
Hmm... impossible.
嗯……不可能。

10:42.586 --> 10:42.724
If I landed here, the trajectory
of my dismembered skull
如果我降落在这里，轨迹
我被肢解的头骨

10:47.517 --> 10:47.655
would cause it to come to rest
not there...
会让它停下来
不在那里...

10:50.793 --> 10:50.931
but here,
exactly five meters due north.
但在这里，
正北五米。

10:53.482 --> 10:53.620
But if that's your head,
then what did I pick up over...?
但如果那是你的头，
那我捡到了什么……？

10:59.000 --> 10:59.103
Brain coral.
脑珊瑚。

11:00.689 --> 11:00.827
No wonder you got
so smart, buddy.
难怪你得到了
太聪明了，伙计。

11:04.000 --> 11:04.103
Here you go, Patrick,
your old head.
给你，帕特里克，
你的老头。

11:06.379 --> 11:06.517
Are you sure you
want to give up being
smart and phosisticated
你确定你
想要放弃存在
智能且精密

11:09.034 --> 11:09.172
to be my friend again?
再次成为我的朋友吗？

11:10.793 --> 11:10.931
Knowledge can never
replace friendship.
知识永远不能
取代友谊。

11:13.034 --> 11:13.172
I prefer to be an idiot.
我宁愿当个白痴。

11:14.586 --> 11:14.724
Not just
an idiot, Patrick.
不只是
一个白痴，帕特里克。

11:16.000 --> 11:16.137
You're also my pal.
你也是我的朋友。

11:21.965 --> 11:22.068
Patrick?
帕特里克？

11:23.517 --> 11:23.655
Say something, Patrick.
说点什么吧，帕特里克。

11:25.758 --> 11:25.896
[ belching]:
Hi, SpongeBob.
[打嗝]：
嗨，海绵宝宝。

11:28.448 --> 11:28.586
Patrick, you're back.
帕特里克，你回来了。

11:29.689 --> 11:29.827
Patrick, you're back.
帕特里克，你回来了。

11:32.034 --> 11:32.172
[ both laughing goofily]
[两人都傻笑]

11:45.482 --> 11:45.620
[ weird jellyfish war cry]
[奇怪的水母战吼]

11:48.068 --> 11:48.206
[ laughing goofily]
[傻笑]

12:03.655 --> 12:03.793
[ playing jazzy tune]
[演奏爵士乐]

12:05.206 --> 12:05.344
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

12:08.965 --> 12:09.068
Squidward, we love you!
章鱼哥，我们爱你！

12:11.413 --> 12:11.551
We love you Squidward,
you're my favorite.
我们爱你章鱼哥
你是我的最爱。

12:14.137 --> 12:14.275
[ Squidward laughing]
[章鱼哥大笑]

12:16.793 --> 12:16.931
[ alarm rings]
[警报响起]

12:20.034 --> 12:20.172
All right, all right.
好吧，好吧。

12:22.724 --> 12:22.862
Time for another
hideous day at work.
是时候换另一个了
工作中可怕的一天。

12:25.965 --> 12:26.068
Uh, just hang in there,
gorgeous.
呃，坚持住，
华丽。

12:28.655 --> 12:28.793
[ plays note on clarinet]
[用单簧管演奏音符]

12:30.620 --> 12:30.758
Your star will shine at
the clarinet recital tomorrow.
你的星星将会闪耀
明天的单簧管演奏会。

12:34.000 --> 12:34.137
[ chuckles]
[笑声]

12:35.758 --> 12:35.896
Time for another glorious day
at work.
是时候迎接又一个辉煌的一天了
在工作中。

12:42.827 --> 12:42.965
Good morning, Squidward.
早上好，章鱼哥。

12:46.000 --> 12:46.137
And isn't it a lovely morning?
这不是一个美好的早晨吗？

12:48.275 --> 12:48.413
Why are you playing
the clarinet?
你为什么玩
单簧管？

12:50.034 --> 12:50.172
I'm practicing
for my clarinet recital.
我正在练习
为了我的单簧管演奏会。

12:54.206 --> 12:54.344
Soon all of Bikini Bottom
很快所有比基尼底部

12:56.689 --> 12:56.827
will recognize the talent
that is Squidward Tentacles.
会认可人才
那是章鱼哥的触手。

13:01.482 --> 13:01.620
Good-bye, SpongeBoob.
再见，海绵宝宝。

13:03.413 --> 13:03.551
See you at the Krusty Krab,
Squidward.
在蟹堡王见，
章鱼哥。

13:06.275 --> 13:06.413
Hey Sandy-- what's this?
嘿桑迪——这是什么？

13:08.034 --> 13:08.172
Well, this here's
my new matter transporter.
嗯，这是这里
我的新物质运输者。

13:10.241 --> 13:10.379
It can move things
from one place to another
它可以移动东西
从一个地方到另一个地方

13:12.241 --> 13:12.379
in the blink of an eye.
眨眼间。

13:13.517 --> 13:13.655
Ooh, that sounds fancy.
哦，听起来很奇特。

13:15.068 --> 13:15.206
Let me show you
how it works.
让我告诉你
它是如何运作的。

13:23.344 --> 13:23.482
Whoa!
哇！

13:27.000 --> 13:27.103
Where'd it go?
它去哪儿了？

13:28.517 --> 13:28.655
Just where you think
it would be.
就在你想到的地方
会的。

13:30.241 --> 13:30.379
[ gasps]:
Oh!
[喘气]：
哦！

13:32.758 --> 13:32.896
Uh-oh,
I'm late for work.
呃哦，
我上班迟到了。

13:34.758 --> 13:34.896
Think your machine could
zap me over to the Krusty Krab?
认为你的机器可以
把我带到蟹堡王那里去？

13:37.172 --> 13:37.310
Always did want
to try a critter.
一直想要
尝试一个小动物。

13:39.137 --> 13:39.275
Sure, why not?
当然可以，为什么不呢？

13:40.793 --> 13:40.931
Get in there,
SpongeBob.
进去吧，
海绵宝宝。

13:42.620 --> 13:42.758
Woo-hoo!
呜呼！

13:44.758 --> 13:44.896
Hold on tight.
紧紧抓住。

13:46.482 --> 13:46.620
SPONGEBOB:
Gee, Sandy, this sure feels...
海绵宝宝：
哎呀，桑迪，这确实感觉……

13:48.068 --> 13:48.206
[ garbled]
[乱码]

13:51.758 --> 13:51.896
Well, here we go again.
好吧，我们又来了。

13:54.517 --> 13:54.655
Hey, Thkwidward.
嘿，特克维德。

13:56.103 --> 13:56.241
[ laughs]
[笑]

14:00.931 --> 14:01.034
What's going on
with this thing?
发生了什么事
用这个东西？

14:04.000 --> 14:04.137
[ screaming]
[尖叫]

14:12.482 --> 14:12.620
What in tarnation?
[ gasps]
什么是塔尼翁？
[喘气]

14:21.103 --> 14:21.241
Hi, Sandy!
嗨，桑迪！

14:22.551 --> 14:22.689
I'm not sure
what it is,
我不确定
它是什么，

14:24.275 --> 14:24.413
but something seems
different about me.
但似乎有什么
对我来说不同。

14:26.586 --> 14:26.724
Yeah-- me, too.
是的——我也是。

14:28.241 --> 14:28.379
Hey, what're you doing
with my hand?
嘿，你在做什么
用我的手？

14:30.620 --> 14:30.758
What... what am I doing
with your hand?
我……我在做什么
用你的手？

14:32.586 --> 14:32.724
[ Squidward screams]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

14:33.896 --> 14:34.000
What is this?
这是什么？

14:35.344 --> 14:35.482
We're all mixed up
together.
我们都搞混了
在一起。

14:36.965 --> 14:37.068
[ Squidward straining]
[章鱼哥紧张]

14:39.034 --> 14:39.172
This is horrible.
这太可怕了。

14:40.689 --> 14:40.827
I have my clarinet
recital tomorrow.
我有我的单簧管
明天的演奏会。

14:43.793 --> 14:43.931
Oh, it's not so bad, Squidward.
噢，情况还不错，章鱼哥。

14:46.413 --> 14:46.551
Now we can be best buddies and
do everything together forever.
现在我们可以成为最好的朋友
永远一起做所有事情。

14:54.000 --> 14:54.103
[ Squidward screams]
[章鱼哥尖叫]

14:55.413 --> 14:55.551
Sandy,
was this your doing?
桑迪，
这是你做的吗？

14:57.034 --> 14:57.172
You've got to
get us separated.
你必须
让我们分开。

14:58.758 --> 14:58.896
Well, I wish I knew how.
好吧，我希望我知道怎么做。

15:00.344 --> 15:00.482
Well, you have to
do something.
好吧，你必须
做某事。

15:02.137 --> 15:02.275
I can't stay
stuck to him.
我不能留下来
粘在他身上。

15:04.103 --> 15:04.241
Hmm, I wonder what would happen
嗯，我想知道会发生什么

15:06.103 --> 15:06.241
if I tried zapping you back
in the transporter?
如果我试着把你拉回来
在运输机中？

15:08.344 --> 15:08.482
Uh, yeah, good idea--
let's do it.
呃，是的，好主意——
让我们开始吧。

15:10.413 --> 15:10.551
Well, here goes nothing.
好吧，这里什么也没有。

15:14.517 --> 15:14.655
TEACHER:
All right, children,
today is Timmy's birthday.
老师：
好吧，孩子们，
今天是蒂米的生日。

15:17.379 --> 15:17.517
You know what that means--
ready, Timmy?
你知道这意味着什么——
准备好了吗，蒂米？

15:20.448 --> 15:20.586
[ strange moaning]
[奇怪的呻吟声]

15:22.793 --> 15:22.931
[ teacher and Timmy screaming]
[老师和蒂米尖叫]

15:26.862 --> 15:26.965
Congratulations,
Mrs. Smith.
恭喜，
史密斯夫人。

15:28.793 --> 15:28.931
You gave birth
to a healthy baby boy.
你生下了
给一个健康的男婴。

15:30.862 --> 15:30.965
May I see my baby?
我可以看看我的宝宝吗？

15:32.310 --> 15:32.448
Of course.
当然。

15:33.620 --> 15:33.758
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

15:38.448 --> 15:38.586
I've been in love
with you
我已经恋爱了
和你在一起

15:40.586 --> 15:40.724
ever since I first
laid my eye on you.
自从我第一次
我的目光落在了你身上。

15:45.896 --> 15:46.000
Hey, baby,
what's your name?
嘿，宝贝，
你叫什么名字？

15:53.586 --> 15:53.724
It's no use, Sandy.
这是没有用的，桑迪。

15:55.344 --> 15:55.482
We're still
the same.
我们还在
一样的。

15:56.896 --> 15:57.000
Well, that's a darn shame.
嗯，这真是太遗憾了。

15:58.931 --> 15:59.034
You know what?
你知道吗？

16:00.931 --> 16:01.034
I was working on the blueprints
for a new invention,
我正在研究蓝图
对于一项新发明，

16:03.413 --> 16:03.551
but it's still
in the embryonic stage.
但它仍然
处于萌芽阶段。

16:05.241 --> 16:05.379
Try anything!
尝试任何事情！

16:07.275 --> 16:07.413
I cannot go to my clarinet
recital like this.
我不能去我的单簧管
像这样的朗诵。

16:10.448 --> 16:10.586
I'll continue working on it.
我会继续努力。

16:12.448 --> 16:12.586
In the meantime,
you boys keep your heads up.
与此同时，
你们小伙子们要抬起头来。

16:16.344 --> 16:16.482
Together forever.
永远在一起。

16:17.793 --> 16:17.931
Misery.
苦难。

16:19.758 --> 16:19.896
SpongeBob, hasn't anybody
taught you how to ride a bike?
海绵宝宝，没有人吗
教你如何骑自行车？

16:23.172 --> 16:23.310
Don't worry, I'll drive.
别担心，我会开车。

16:24.655 --> 16:24.793
Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！

16:26.068 --> 16:26.206
SpongeBob!
Ow! Ow! Ow!
海绵宝宝！
噢！噢！噢！

16:27.413 --> 16:27.551
Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow! Ow!
噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！噢！

16:31.448 --> 16:31.586
I got to lay off the hot sauce.
我必须戒掉辣酱。

16:35.000 --> 16:35.103
[ crashing]
[崩溃]

16:40.000 --> 16:40.137
What in blazes
is going on in here?
大火中的什么
这里发生什么事了？

16:42.000 --> 16:42.137
Oh, hi, Mr. Krabs.
哦，嗨，蟹老板。

16:44.103 --> 16:44.241
What are you two doing
laying around?
你们两个在做什么
躺着吗？

16:46.000 --> 16:46.103
Get to work!
开始工作吧！

16:47.068 --> 16:47.206
If you say so.
如果你这么说的话。

16:49.379 --> 16:49.517
Egad! What happened to you?
哎呀！你怎么了？

16:51.620 --> 16:51.758
Uh, I don't want to know.
呃，我不想知道。

16:53.482 --> 16:53.620
Just go do your jobs.
去做你的工作吧。

16:55.172 --> 16:55.310
Aye, aye,
cap'n!
是啊，是啊，
船长！

16:57.172 --> 16:57.310
Do you have to be such
an accommodating buffoon?
你一定要这样吗
一个乐于助人的小丑？

17:00.758 --> 17:00.896
Squidward, everybody
knows I'm a sponge.
乌贼王大家
知道我是一块海绵。

17:03.482 --> 17:03.620
I look nothing like a balloon.
我看起来一点也不像气球。

17:05.103 --> 17:05.241
I don't have time for this.
我没有时间做这个。

17:07.379 --> 17:07.517
I got to man
the cash register.
我得去男人
收银机。

17:09.275 --> 17:09.413
[ straining
[ 拉紧

17:12.103 --> 17:12.241
Whew!
哇！

17:13.241 --> 17:13.379
Can I help you?
我可以帮你吗？

17:14.724 --> 17:14.862
Two Krabby Patties,
please.
两块蟹肉饼，
请。

17:16.793 --> 17:16.931
SQUIDWARD:
SpongeBob, I need two
Krabby Patties.
章鱼哥：
海绵宝宝，我需要两个
蟹肉饼。

17:18.620 --> 17:18.758
Two Krabby Patties
coming right up.
两块蟹肉饼
马上就来了。

17:23.551 --> 17:23.689
I can't reach the bun.
我够不到面包。

17:25.655 --> 17:25.793
SpongeBob, what's the hold up?
海绵宝宝，怎么了？

17:27.862 --> 17:27.965
S-sorry, Mr. Krabs,
I'm on it.
对不起，蟹老板先生，
我正在做。

17:30.551 --> 17:30.689
Time is money, boy.
时间就是金钱，孩子。

17:33.000 --> 17:33.103
Time is money, right.
时间就是金钱，对吧。

17:35.137 --> 17:35.275
[ struggling]
[挣扎]

17:36.482 --> 17:36.620
Hello, bun, at last we meet.
你好，小包子，我们终于见面了。

17:38.931 --> 17:39.034
[ screams]
[尖叫声]

17:40.551 --> 17:40.689
[ horrific scream]
[可怕的尖叫声]

17:43.068 --> 17:43.206
And now for...
现在对于...

17:44.310 --> 17:44.448
[ both screaming]
[两人都尖叫]

17:45.724 --> 17:45.862
All right, that's it.
好吧，就是这样。

17:49.793 --> 17:49.931
I can't afford you
jeopardizing my business.
我买不起你
危及我的生意。

17:52.103 --> 17:52.241
You two are more trouble
than you're worth.
你们两个更麻烦
比你的价值还高。

17:55.034 --> 17:55.172
And don't come back until you
get this problem sorted out.
直到你回来为止
解决这个问题。

17:59.655 --> 17:59.793
SPONGEBOB:
Look on the bright side,
Squidward.
海绵宝宝：
往好的方面看，
章鱼哥。

18:01.827 --> 18:01.965
At least we still have
each other.
至少我们还有
彼此。

18:04.000 --> 18:04.137
That's how we got in this
predicament in the first place.
这就是我们如何进入这个
首先陷入困境。

18:07.103 --> 18:07.241
Now, if you'll excuse me,
I'd like a moment of peace.
现在，请原谅我，
我想要片刻的平静。

18:11.620 --> 18:11.758
[ starts playing clarinet]
[开始演奏单簧管]

18:14.931 --> 18:15.034
Whoa!
Rock on, freaky bro.
哇！
摇滚吧，怪异兄弟。

18:17.689 --> 18:17.827
SQUIDWARD:
Sandy! Sandy!
章鱼哥：
桑迪！沙！

18:19.655 --> 18:19.793
Please tell me you've figured
out a way to separate us.
请告诉我你已经想到了
想办法把我们分开。

18:22.172 --> 18:22.310
Say hello to the
molecular separator ray.
向
分子分离射线。

18:24.827 --> 18:24.965
Hello, molecular separator ray.
你好，分子分离器射线。

18:27.620 --> 18:27.758
Well, let's get on with it.
好吧，让我们继续吧。

18:29.413 --> 18:29.551
My clarinet recital
is tomorrow night.
我的单簧管演奏会
是明天晚上。

18:31.827 --> 18:31.965
Uh, well, I'm not quite
done with it yet.
呃，好吧，我还不太
还没完成呢。

18:34.310 --> 18:34.448
What?
什么？

18:35.827 --> 18:35.965
I'm still
putting it together.
我还在
把它放在一起。

18:37.448 --> 18:37.586
At best
I'll have it ready,
充其量
我这就准备好

18:38.862 --> 18:38.965
uh... day after tomorrow maybe?
呃……也许是后天？

18:40.965 --> 18:41.068
What?
Day after tomorrow?
什么？
后天？

18:42.620 --> 18:42.758
No, no, no, no!
不，不，不，不！

18:44.103 --> 18:44.241
I have a performance
tomorrow.
我有表演
明天。

18:46.068 --> 18:46.206
I can't be stuck
to that yellow freak.
我不能被困住
到那个黄色怪物。

18:50.172 --> 18:50.310
Sandy, please--
you got to do it
before the show.
桑迪，请——
你必须这么做
演出前。

18:54.206 --> 18:54.344
Well, uh,
I suppose...
嗯，呃，
我想...

18:56.689 --> 18:56.827
I'll have it ready
before you go on.
我会准备好
在你继续之前。

19:12.586 --> 19:12.724
[ straining]
[紧张]

19:16.448 --> 19:16.586
SQUIDWARD:
Of course.
章鱼哥：
当然。

19:21.620 --> 19:21.758
Oh, my.
哦，我的。

19:24.413 --> 19:24.551
Where are you Sandy?
桑迪你在哪里？

19:26.758 --> 19:26.896
Sandy?
沙？

19:29.137 --> 19:29.275
I can't do it,
I can't go out there.
我做不到，
我不能出去那里。

19:32.103 --> 19:32.241
Squidward...
this is your moment,
章鱼哥...
这是你的时刻，

19:35.793 --> 19:35.931
the story you will tell
你要讲的故事

19:37.793 --> 19:37.931
when you look back
as a... superstar.
当你回头看时
作为...超级巨星。

19:41.655 --> 19:41.793
Superstar?
超级巨星？

19:43.413 --> 19:43.551
Now go out there
and give them
现在出去吧
并给他们

19:45.275 --> 19:45.413
the best darned show
they've ever seen.
最好的该死的表演
他们曾经见过。

19:47.620 --> 19:47.758
You're right--
the show must go on.
你是对的——
演出必须继续下去。

19:50.827 --> 19:50.965
ANNOUNCER:
Ladies and gentlefish,
播音员：
女士们和温柔的鱼，

19:53.413 --> 19:53.551
Bikini Bottom's
community rec center
比基尼泳裤
社区休闲中心

19:55.862 --> 19:55.965
is proud to present
Squidward Tentacles.
很自豪地呈现
章鱼哥的触手。

19:59.310 --> 19:59.448
[ applause]
[鼓掌]

20:01.620 --> 20:01.758
[ crowd oohs]
[人群哦]

20:03.551 --> 20:03.689
[ playing soulful tune]
【演奏深情的曲子】

20:08.344 --> 20:08.482
Honey, I'm scared.
亲爱的，我很害怕。

20:10.137 --> 20:10.275
[ continues playing]
[继续播放]

20:17.517 --> 20:17.655
[ cloth tears]
[布泪]

20:21.103 --> 20:21.241
[ crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

20:25.034 --> 20:25.172
Uh... hi.
呃...嗨。

20:27.724 --> 20:27.862
Whoa!
哇！

20:29.827 --> 20:29.965
[ laughs]
[笑]

20:31.310 --> 20:31.448
Rock on, freaky bro.
摇滚吧，怪异兄弟。

20:33.448 --> 20:33.586
Yeah! Whoo!
是的！呼！

20:35.344 --> 20:35.482
[ crowd commenting]
[群众评论]

20:39.000 --> 20:39.103
[ cheering and whistling]
[欢呼声和口哨声]

20:41.413 --> 20:41.551
Wow,
they really liked it.
哇，
他们真的很喜欢它。

20:43.896 --> 20:44.000
MR. KRABS:
There you go, Squiddy.
先生。螃蟹：
就这样吧，乌贼。

20:46.344 --> 20:46.482
[ crowd cheering]
[人群欢呼]

20:49.689 --> 20:49.827
They... they...
they're cheering.
他们……他们……
他们在欢呼。

20:52.965 --> 20:53.068
Superstardom-- this must
be what it feels like.
巨星——这必须
就是它的感觉。

20:57.551 --> 20:57.689
This is what it looks like,
这就是它的样子，

21:00.620 --> 21:00.758
what it... sounds like,
这……听起来像什么，

21:04.068 --> 21:04.206
and... [ inhales deeply]
what it smells like.
还有……[深吸一口气]
闻起来像什么。

21:08.758 --> 21:08.896
Wow, simply intoxicating.
哇，简直让人陶醉。

21:13.517 --> 21:13.655
Whoo-wee!
Well, there you boys are.
哇哦！
好吧，你们孩子们就在那里。

21:16.275 --> 21:16.413
Looks like I'm just in time.
看来我来得正是时候。

21:17.965 --> 21:18.068
Sandy?
沙？

21:19.551 --> 21:19.689
One blast of this
molecular separator ray
这一击一发
分子分离射线

21:21.275 --> 21:21.413
and you'll be
separated for good.
你会
永远分开。

21:23.206 --> 21:23.344
No, no wait--
Sandy, don't.
不，不用等——
桑迪，别这样。

21:27.689 --> 21:27.827
[ crowd gasps]
[人群喘息]

21:29.137 --> 21:29.275
[ disappointed grumbling]
[失望的抱怨]

21:34.620 --> 21:34.758
[ starts playing clarinet]
[开始演奏单簧管]

21:40.517 --> 21:40.655
I think I'm going to be sick.
我想我会生病的。

21:46.310 --> 21:46.448
Ah, I'm out of here.
啊，我要离开这里了。

21:48.689 --> 21:48.827
Huh?
No, wait, wait!
啊？
不，等等，等等！

21:53.000 --> 21:53.137
Aw, come on.
噢，来吧。

21:55.413 --> 21:55.551
Oh, my one moment
of fame gone.
哦，我的一刻
名气消失了。

22:01.758 --> 22:01.896
There's got to be some way
to reverse this.
一定有什么办法
扭转这一局面。

22:04.517 --> 22:04.655
No, Squidward,
that's a very sensitive device.
不，章鱼哥，
那是一个非常敏感的设备。

22:09.241 --> 22:09.379
Squidward,
I wouldn't...
章鱼哥，
我不会...

22:12.827 --> 22:12.965
So, what seems to be
the problem, Mr. Tentacles?
那么，似乎是什么
触手先生，有什么问题吗？

22:16.931 --> 22:17.034
It all started when I was born.
这一切都从我出生时开始。

